; Handwritten malformed geometry stays raw, including ARC angles equal only after normalization; a coincident LINE is managed.
; Raw DXF values independently checked against CI run 39925415850, job 120320505295.
; The raw oracle reports E6 as ARC (0 != 360); P11 classifies it after modulo 360, so it is unhandled.
D = DXF file=input.dxf
? count D -> LINE 1
? unhandled D -> ARC 4; CIRCLE 2
? entity D E1 -> unhandled CIRCLE
? entity D E2 -> unhandled CIRCLE
? entity D E3 -> unhandled ARC
? entity D E4 -> unhandled ARC
? entity D E5 -> unhandled ARC
? entity D E6 -> unhandled ARC
? entity D E7 -> LINE start=0,0 end=0,0
? roundtrip D -> identical
